        "created_at": "2017-04-17T13:49:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As a playtester I am excited!</p><p>I am ready to playtest this, even have a group together. I took all the Heroes they showed and the very primitive play test we got so far to make new Heroes. I told everyone that this is a play test and we will be redoing the heroes once they release it. It is a very interesting system and I am enjoying it alot. It is a very Naritive drivien game. It has become my favorite RPG system.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>There are a few Images on the internet of all the Heroes they showed at cons (link below), and &nbsp;there is aYoutube video with Christopher explaining the game.&nbsp;</span></p><p>https://www.dropbox.com/sh/ywp8zt8orn8vtm8/AAD1Knes9QC_OnkhcavteMKOa?dl=0</p><p>I am hyped!</p>",
