      {
        "id": 195346,
        "name": "glenn frog knight",
        "username": "glenn_frog_knight",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/aeb1de/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-05-03T01:19:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"speedyolrac\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/speedyolrac/48/1918_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> speedyolrac:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>As a playtester I am excited!I am ready to playtest this, even have a group together. I took all the Heroes they showed and the very primitive play test we got so far to make new Heroes. I told everyone that this is a play test and we will be redoing the heroes once they release it. It is a very interesting system and I am enjoying it alot. It is a very Naritive drivien game. It has become my favorite RPG system.&nbsp;There are a few Images on the internet of all the Heroes they showed at cons (link below), and &nbsp;there is aYoutube video with Christopher explaining the game.&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/sh/ywp8zt8orn8vtm8/AAD1Knes9QC_OnkhcavteMKOa?dl=0I\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.dropbox.com/sh/ywp8zt8orn8vtm8/AAD1Knes9QC_OnkhcavteMKOa?dl=0I</a> am hyped!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Hmm, thanks for sharing! Super interesting!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I love how the Wraith's Powers (stats, really) aren't very high. Compared to Tachyon's all 8s and 10s, she's got a few 6s… but then when you look at where she's put training into, Qualities, she's through the roof! Great representation of the drive they talked about in their Letters Page on her.</p>",
